WEBVTT

00:06.000 --> 00:09.625
THIS FILM IS A WORK OF FICTION
CREATED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY

00:22.416 --> 00:26.125
DUBAI

00:26.958 --> 00:29.041
Get the gauze and notify the doctor.

00:36.833 --> 00:38.291
He needs the blood now.

00:52.041 --> 00:54.541
OUT OF ABOUT EIGHT BILLION PEOPLE
ON EARTH,

00:54.625 --> 00:59.375
ONLY 0.00000625% HAVE
THE RAREST BLOOD TYPE

01:16.041 --> 01:19.583
FOR THOSE WHO NEED IT,
THIS BLOOD TYPE CAN MEAN LIFE OR DEATH

01:19.666 --> 01:22.666
THEY CALL THEMSELVES AURUM BLOOD

01:37.083 --> 01:39.708
So be it. My boss must live.

01:43.458 --> 01:44.875
I'll find another.

01:51.125 --> 01:54.416
And keep all his organs.
We may need them later.

02:33.375 --> 02:36.250
Get me the new source. Forget the cost.

02:39.750 --> 02:43.125
VIETNAM

04:10.041 --> 04:11.166
The choice is yours.

04:12.250 --> 04:14.875
We can arrange any kind of death you want.

04:14.958 --> 04:19.500
It could be a car accident, poisoning,
or even staged to look like self-harm.

04:20.208 --> 04:23.666
If the target has bodyguards,
we can take care of them too.

04:24.166 --> 04:27.333
I'll send our service packages
and price list for you to look over.

04:27.416 --> 04:29.416
We can talk again when I'm back.

04:29.500 --> 04:31.083
I'm overseas right now.

04:33.166 --> 04:34.000
Certainly.

04:37.500 --> 04:40.916
You really think this kid's the one?

04:44.666 --> 04:46.666
You've asked me that, like, four times.

04:50.125 --> 04:50.958
Bro.

04:52.500 --> 04:55.041
You really cleared everything
with the kid's parents?

04:55.125 --> 04:57.375
Yeah, no problem. We made the payment.

04:57.458 --> 04:58.916
We can just take her with us.

06:45.833 --> 06:48.250
Hey. The kid's in bad shape.

06:55.916 --> 07:01.750
MY DEAREST ASSASSIN

07:08.541 --> 07:12.291
I've never seen any of the assassin houses
use a gun like this.

07:13.375 --> 07:14.791
Who do you think he is?

07:14.875 --> 07:16.750
I'm guessing he's a hunter.

07:17.375 --> 07:18.916
A hunter for hire.

07:19.625 --> 07:23.916
Anyone can hire them to find anything.
People, animals, objects.

07:24.000 --> 07:26.666
They find whatever the hell you want
if you have the money.

07:27.166 --> 07:29.416
Do you know who took the girl?

07:33.250 --> 07:36.041
Since you already took
part of your payment,

07:37.125 --> 07:40.125
that will put you in debt with us.

07:40.208 --> 07:42.625
If you can find an Aurum Blood,

07:42.708 --> 07:45.375
whether it be a new one or an old one…

07:56.750 --> 07:59.166
You must find one.

08:11.333 --> 08:13.791
You think he's working a contract?

08:13.875 --> 08:17.291
Or is he just hunting her
to sell on the open market?

08:17.375 --> 08:20.666
Whether it's blood or organs,
there's a market for it.

08:21.791 --> 08:23.958
Either way, it's bad news for us.

08:28.583 --> 08:31.083
We need to watch our backs
when we get back.

08:32.208 --> 08:35.291
I've got a feeling
everyone will want this girl.

08:37.625 --> 08:40.541
BANGKOK

08:51.333 --> 08:53.500
No one's gonna hurt you, honey.

08:54.666 --> 08:57.083
Come on, hurry!

08:57.166 --> 08:59.750
Hello. You're welcome here.

09:00.541 --> 09:02.916
Hello. You're welcome here.

09:03.916 --> 09:05.958
Everyone here is friendly.

09:06.458 --> 09:09.625
We'll take care of you just like family,
okay, honey?

09:10.416 --> 09:12.541
Everyone here is friendly.

09:13.083 --> 09:16.125
We'll take care of you like family.

09:25.000 --> 09:25.833
Wait!

09:38.333 --> 09:39.208
That was awesome.

09:39.791 --> 09:40.625
Follow her.

09:45.208 --> 09:46.750
-Easy.
-Back up. Wait.

10:01.625 --> 10:03.041
You're bleeding.

10:04.208 --> 10:05.125
You're bleeding.

10:08.750 --> 10:10.125
You're bleeding.

10:20.083 --> 10:21.458
My goodness.

10:23.958 --> 10:28.458
That'll leave a scar for sure, kiddo.
This will hurt a little. Goodness.

10:31.041 --> 10:33.750
I need to draw some blood, okay?

10:39.125 --> 10:40.958
Just a little sting.

10:45.583 --> 10:46.750
Just a little sting.

11:04.500 --> 11:07.333
Son, do you think
you can take good care of her?

11:14.750 --> 11:16.083
She's got no one else now.

11:17.875 --> 11:20.125
That's why I brought her to live here.

11:22.625 --> 11:23.750
Like M?

11:37.083 --> 11:38.375
That day,

11:38.875 --> 11:40.500
I really didn't know

11:41.000 --> 11:43.750
why these people saved me

11:44.541 --> 11:46.666
or why I had to stay here.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.250
All I knew was

11:49.333 --> 11:51.208
in his eyes,

11:51.291 --> 11:54.958
there was something
that made me calm down and trust him.

11:55.541 --> 12:00.041
This girl's blood is compatible
with any Rh-null blood type.

12:00.625 --> 12:04.000
You're very lucky.
You found a super rare case.

12:04.083 --> 12:08.083
Does that mean
her parents had the same blood type?

12:08.666 --> 12:12.000
Maybe it was just
two recessive genes coming together.

12:16.958 --> 12:18.916
So, when can we start collecting?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.125
Not yet.

12:20.208 --> 12:21.791
She's still too young.

12:21.875 --> 12:25.833
Once drawn, the blood only lasts
about 40 days.

12:26.333 --> 12:27.166
Remember,

12:27.250 --> 12:30.958
the best blood is the blood
that's still inside the body.

12:37.458 --> 12:40.625
I had no choice
but to become a member of House 89.

12:45.958 --> 12:48.708
The house looks
like it's just a secondhand store.

12:48.791 --> 12:50.958
But it's not.

13:18.041 --> 13:22.083
The only thing I'm free to do
in this house

13:23.833 --> 13:28.083
is to remember
the person who took everything from me.

13:39.541 --> 13:42.916
Take good care of her.
Don't ever let her leave.

14:55.833 --> 14:56.666
Rain.

15:00.833 --> 15:01.958
Rain.

15:03.333 --> 15:04.416
Rain.

15:05.416 --> 15:06.583
Rain.

15:10.750 --> 15:11.791
Pran.

15:14.000 --> 15:14.875
Lhan.

15:18.458 --> 15:22.083
Hey, what are you doing?
Get inside, doofus. You'll get sick.

15:22.916 --> 15:23.958
Get over here.

15:24.041 --> 15:24.875
What?

15:24.958 --> 15:25.791
-Come here.
-Wait.

15:25.875 --> 15:27.125
-Come on.
-What?

15:27.208 --> 15:28.041
Come play with me.

15:28.125 --> 15:29.833
-Play with me.
-What are you doing?

17:03.833 --> 17:04.833
Let me dry you off.

17:29.583 --> 17:32.500
INDIA

17:35.250 --> 17:38.125
-How long will it take?
-Let us see, brother.

17:57.166 --> 17:59.291
-Has your report been confirmed?
-Get out!

18:00.541 --> 18:02.250
Where'd these people come from?

18:07.500 --> 18:09.041
It's fine, brother. It's negative.

18:14.041 --> 18:15.833
They all have Rh blood types.

18:15.916 --> 18:17.500
But not what we're looking for.

18:36.958 --> 18:38.958
Be cool, bro.
I know you're annoyed, but listen.

18:39.041 --> 18:41.416
This country's full of people.
Some may be off-grid.

19:15.125 --> 19:16.250
There's none here.

19:17.166 --> 19:21.416
It's been a long time since we last found
anyone with Aurum Blood.

19:21.500 --> 19:24.208
You have to go back to Vietnam

19:24.291 --> 19:27.833
and find the ones who know
where they took her.

19:27.916 --> 19:29.375
Vietnam?

19:31.416 --> 19:34.583
I don't think
the ones who took her are hunters, okay?

19:36.000 --> 19:38.541
I don't even know who they are.
I'm afraid that you--

19:38.625 --> 19:41.125
You've already gotten 20 million.

19:41.625 --> 19:43.625
Even if they are God,

19:43.708 --> 19:45.375
you bring her back.

20:11.166 --> 20:14.916
Why does M have to do all this training?
What's it for?

20:15.416 --> 20:16.250
It's his duty.

20:17.208 --> 20:19.041
Everyone in this house has a duty.

20:20.500 --> 20:22.875
What about me? What's my duty?

20:24.250 --> 20:26.375
You don't have one… I guess.

20:28.458 --> 20:29.416
Why not?

20:29.916 --> 20:31.750
And what's your duty, Pran?

20:33.625 --> 20:35.000
I don't have one either.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.166
Well, I look after you.

20:43.458 --> 20:46.000
By keeping me in here?
That's called being a jailer.

20:49.666 --> 20:52.000
Well, it's safer at home.

20:52.708 --> 20:54.708
Staying safe by staying at home.

20:55.208 --> 20:56.583
That's called fear.

21:08.041 --> 21:12.708
Not enough strength.
Not enough training. Not enough speed.

21:21.458 --> 21:22.875
Come on, kid.

21:22.958 --> 21:24.416
It's your duty.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.625
He just knows you too well.

21:30.125 --> 21:32.958
He can tell where you're going
just from your stance.

21:35.416 --> 21:36.625
Wanna try something?

21:37.500 --> 21:38.708
It might be easier.

21:40.916 --> 21:41.916
Okay.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.041
Get ready, okay?

21:51.166 --> 21:53.041
Yeah. Okay.

22:03.125 --> 22:03.958
Wait!

22:04.041 --> 22:05.250
You can do that?

22:09.291 --> 22:10.291
This guy,

22:10.375 --> 22:12.625
he's been making me teach him for years.

22:13.250 --> 22:15.541
-I've lost a lot of sleep because of him.
-Hey.

22:16.125 --> 22:17.208
It's a secret, okay?

22:23.000 --> 22:24.208
Let me try again.

22:24.833 --> 22:25.708
Okay.

22:26.791 --> 22:27.666
Come on.

22:33.083 --> 22:34.083
Shit!

22:36.583 --> 22:37.666
Fine.

22:46.250 --> 22:48.375
-I see.
-Got that?

22:50.000 --> 22:51.625
You just gotta flip the pattern.

22:51.708 --> 22:54.791
Left to right, front to back,
like wearing your top inside out.

22:56.416 --> 22:58.291
Shit, you're a hotshot.

23:08.166 --> 23:10.750
He'll be caught off guard,
so you can get in close.

23:30.291 --> 23:32.958
Now you just control the distance
and choose your attack.

23:34.500 --> 23:36.958
Aim for his weak spots
if you can find them.

23:43.125 --> 23:46.916
If you don't know who you're fighting,
how do you know their weakness?

23:47.416 --> 23:50.000
In that case,
you might have to take a hit first.

23:50.500 --> 23:51.750
Just to find out.

24:32.791 --> 24:34.875
The birthday boy got too drunk
and passed out.

24:39.458 --> 24:42.708
Why don't you tell your dad you can fight?
And that you're good at it?

24:44.000 --> 24:46.750
He probably doesn't want me
in his line of work.

24:46.833 --> 24:48.833
The kind where you have to go outside.

24:49.875 --> 24:51.875
So he just wants you to sell stuff?

24:52.375 --> 24:55.458
You wanna do that?
Or you wanna work outside like the others?

24:56.000 --> 24:57.125
I don't know.

24:57.750 --> 24:59.125
It's how I was raised.

24:59.958 --> 25:03.541
I really don't know
if it's what I actually want.

25:07.875 --> 25:09.333
But taking care of you,

25:09.916 --> 25:11.083
I do wanna do that.

25:12.458 --> 25:13.291
I like it.

25:19.541 --> 25:20.583
What about you?

25:22.333 --> 25:24.333
Is there anything you'd love to do?

25:30.041 --> 25:31.083
Well?

25:35.541 --> 25:37.541
There is, but…

25:38.250 --> 25:41.333
It doesn't matter now.
I wouldn't even know where to start.

25:48.250 --> 25:49.166
All done.

25:49.250 --> 25:50.458
Come here.

25:50.541 --> 25:52.541
What? Here.

25:53.166 --> 25:54.000
Put it away.

25:55.250 --> 25:57.250
-Hey, don't.
-Let me paint yours.

25:57.333 --> 25:58.250
What? No.

25:58.333 --> 25:59.708
-Just let me.
-No.

26:13.791 --> 26:17.416
For this job,
our target has four bodyguards.

26:18.958 --> 26:22.833
The entry and exit points are
on the plans I gave you.

26:22.916 --> 26:26.875
Also, I heard other houses might try
to steal this job from us.

26:28.041 --> 26:30.041
Shit, it's gonna be a tough one.

26:35.541 --> 26:36.791
So should we bring M too?

26:39.083 --> 26:40.250
You think he's ready?

26:41.833 --> 26:44.291
Well, that could be good.

26:44.375 --> 26:46.250
He's been improving a lot lately.

26:53.458 --> 26:55.958
Then let's finish discussing this
in the office.

26:56.041 --> 26:56.875
Okay.

27:05.708 --> 27:06.583
Go on.

27:30.583 --> 27:32.083
Why don't we go out?

28:02.833 --> 28:03.875
Do I look pretty?

28:08.916 --> 28:09.958
Hair up or down?

28:10.041 --> 28:10.916
Up?

28:11.416 --> 28:12.291
Down?

28:15.916 --> 28:17.708
You look pretty either way.

28:19.916 --> 28:21.541
Why are you all dressed up?

28:21.625 --> 28:22.500
I'm going out.

28:22.583 --> 28:24.083
Pran's taking me out.

28:24.666 --> 28:26.625
Don't tell Pran I'm wearing this.

28:28.041 --> 28:29.708
You're not allowed to go, are you?

28:29.791 --> 28:33.000
We're sneaking out.
No one's gonna be home tonight, are they?

28:33.958 --> 28:35.166
Not a word, okay?

28:40.208 --> 28:41.791
You think Pran will like it?

28:44.250 --> 28:45.333
Of course he will.

28:47.541 --> 28:48.916
He'd be crazy not to.

29:13.750 --> 29:15.583
When do I get to go with you, Dad?

29:26.875 --> 29:28.791
Go. Get ready.

30:00.208 --> 30:01.083
This way, ma'am.

30:07.541 --> 30:09.000
How is this beautiful?

30:09.625 --> 30:11.291
What's beautiful about it?

30:11.958 --> 30:14.583
And this shit costs 180,000?
That's insane.

30:15.083 --> 30:16.625
Even I'm prettier than this.

30:21.791 --> 30:22.916
House 89.

30:27.458 --> 30:28.833
Then hurry up.

30:37.416 --> 30:38.583
Mala.

30:42.125 --> 30:43.208
Shit.

30:44.791 --> 30:45.833
What do we do?

30:49.833 --> 30:52.000
The target is in zone one.

30:52.750 --> 30:54.583
He's with four guards.

30:55.458 --> 30:59.916
Take out the Mala gang first.
Then take out the target.

31:55.375 --> 31:57.625
Are you wearing non-slip shoes, honey?

31:57.708 --> 31:59.666
It's gonna get really bloody tonight.

32:03.166 --> 32:04.375
They're not bad.

32:04.875 --> 32:07.458
Non-slip. Even on assholes' blood.

32:20.541 --> 32:23.833
Plan B. M's the only one
they won't recognize.

32:24.333 --> 32:26.375
Time to show them what you've got, kid.

32:27.875 --> 32:29.958
-Okay, this way, sir.
-This way, sir.

33:27.416 --> 33:29.250
-Hey!
-Let's go!

33:31.083 --> 33:32.916
The target's going in as planned.

33:33.791 --> 33:34.958
Take him out.

33:36.958 --> 33:38.458
-Come on!
-Hey, go on!

33:38.958 --> 33:40.541
Get away. Come on!

33:41.541 --> 33:42.875
Come on!

34:00.708 --> 34:01.875
Kill confirmed.

34:01.958 --> 34:04.083
Target eliminated.

34:10.083 --> 34:13.125
Not bad for your first job, kiddo.

34:16.916 --> 34:19.791
House 89, mission accomplished.

34:41.791 --> 34:44.208
The Amber Hymns album by Enoch Rayburne.

34:44.791 --> 34:47.208
The legendary hand-pressed vinyl edition.

34:48.208 --> 34:51.291
You're one of only 14 people
in the world who own this.

34:53.333 --> 34:55.083
I do like the sound of that.

34:55.583 --> 34:57.250
Only 14 people in the world.

34:57.333 --> 34:59.083
Yes. I really like it too.

35:00.583 --> 35:03.750
Owning something this rare,

35:05.041 --> 35:06.708
it feels

35:08.000 --> 35:09.458
magnificent.

35:12.791 --> 35:16.666
Oh, and I heard
you'll be back in Thailand for a while.

35:17.666 --> 35:21.041
Is it just for R & R, or are you hunting
something for a client too?

35:22.541 --> 35:25.333
Actually, I'm looking for
something very important.

35:25.958 --> 35:28.041
I think I'll find it soon.

35:29.833 --> 35:31.250
How do you know that?

35:36.875 --> 35:38.666
I'm a hunter.

35:40.250 --> 35:42.000
I can almost smell it.

36:04.958 --> 36:06.458
Where did you get that dress?

36:08.708 --> 36:09.833
Don't you like it?

36:14.208 --> 36:15.125
I do like it.

36:20.125 --> 36:22.541
Hair up or down?

37:00.458 --> 37:04.791
I'll have three of these,
and… three more with sausage.

37:04.875 --> 37:05.708
Sure.

37:11.666 --> 37:12.833
-Here you go.
-How much?

37:12.916 --> 37:13.750
Sixty baht.

37:20.041 --> 37:21.000
Is it good?

40:25.375 --> 40:29.125
Wow! How are you doing,
you handsome young man?

40:30.458 --> 40:32.500
Hello, Ms. Chaba. Mr. Blue.

40:51.958 --> 40:53.125
Wow.

40:58.625 --> 41:01.958
If you're willing to take the job,
you can take the first payment now.

41:02.875 --> 41:03.791
If you accept.

41:09.791 --> 41:10.625
What the fuck?

41:13.458 --> 41:16.166
What's your fucking beef
with the people in this house?

41:17.166 --> 41:18.666
They took what's mine.

41:19.166 --> 41:20.750
They fucking wasted my time.

41:21.250 --> 41:23.250
House 89 is a house of assassins.

41:23.333 --> 41:24.166
Yep.

41:24.791 --> 41:29.000
That's my point exactly.
I'm hiring assassins to kill assassins.

41:29.083 --> 41:30.875
It's to maintain the balance.

41:45.333 --> 41:48.666
I heard you lost money to them
a few days ago. Is that true?

41:54.000 --> 41:56.166
Not sure if you've thought about it.

41:57.125 --> 41:59.208
If House 89 were gone,

41:59.291 --> 42:01.541
imagine how much more you'd earn.

42:18.708 --> 42:21.041
Someone saw you take Lhan out.

42:25.750 --> 42:27.708
The others were working their asses off.

42:27.791 --> 42:30.541
How could you two
just sneak out to go have fun?

42:33.791 --> 42:35.708
So take me along, Dad.

42:36.791 --> 42:38.166
Give me something to do.

42:38.250 --> 42:40.583
You have one job. Look after Lhan.

42:40.666 --> 42:41.833
And I'm doing that.

42:41.916 --> 42:44.416
Isn't taking her out
part of looking after her?

42:45.125 --> 42:47.208
She's never been outside
since she got here.

42:47.291 --> 42:48.833
She has a life to live too.

42:49.333 --> 42:51.583
Everyone has their own life.

42:52.083 --> 42:56.250
But no one should suffer
just because of your foolish ideas.

42:56.958 --> 42:57.833
Suffer how?

42:58.333 --> 43:00.500
What damn ideas?
What's foolish about them?

43:01.000 --> 43:03.458
I just wish Lhan could do
what everyone else does.

43:03.541 --> 43:05.458
What's wrong with that?

43:06.000 --> 43:09.458
You want me to look after her?
I'm doing that.

43:09.541 --> 43:11.583
Just let me do it my way, damn it.

43:12.083 --> 43:16.291
If something actually happened,
all your silly little secret training

43:16.375 --> 43:18.083
won't stand a chance against anyone.

43:18.166 --> 43:19.250
Listen to me.

43:19.333 --> 43:22.375
M can beat everyone in this house,
including you,

43:23.416 --> 43:24.708
because I tell him how.

43:25.708 --> 43:27.166
I'm the one who taught him.

43:30.375 --> 43:31.250
You didn't know?

43:31.750 --> 43:35.333
-Because you never look at your own son.
-Lhan can't go that far from home yet.

43:35.416 --> 43:37.916
There's a price on her.
People are still after her.

43:38.000 --> 43:42.666
Why did you say there's a price on her?
And who would take her away?

43:44.750 --> 43:46.750
What do you mean, she has a price?

43:48.583 --> 43:49.500
Dad.

43:51.916 --> 43:54.625
-Just say it--
-Lhan's blood has a price on it!

44:00.583 --> 44:01.833
Dad!

44:03.708 --> 44:05.458
What I did to get her,

44:05.541 --> 44:08.500
to find her,
do you know how fucking hard that was?

44:09.083 --> 44:11.250
If you can't get that through your head,

44:11.333 --> 44:15.916
and you still dare sneak out together,
should I just separate you forever?

44:16.916 --> 44:17.916
Stop.

44:48.333 --> 44:49.333
You love her.

44:50.916 --> 44:52.041
I can see it.

44:52.541 --> 44:55.708
Lhan can stay safe here with you.

44:56.625 --> 44:58.750
But she'll never go anywhere.

44:58.833 --> 45:02.250
Some people just don't get to live
the life they want.

45:04.333 --> 45:05.833
Just accept it.

45:05.916 --> 45:07.708
It'll be easier that way.

45:45.708 --> 45:46.791
Go home?

45:46.875 --> 45:47.708
Yeah.

45:48.208 --> 45:50.291
Wherever you wanna go,
whatever you wanna do,

45:50.375 --> 45:52.000
we'll find a way together.

45:52.083 --> 45:53.750
I know I can look after you.

45:53.833 --> 45:55.666
And the others? What about M?

45:56.166 --> 45:57.541
M can't know this yet.

45:57.625 --> 45:59.750
You need to leave,
then figure out the rest.

46:01.000 --> 46:03.791
Hurry and pack your stuff.
We're leaving tonight.

47:13.291 --> 47:16.208
PRAN: JUST LEFT MY ROOM

47:45.291 --> 47:46.416
Wait.

47:50.625 --> 47:51.916
Don't shoot the girl.

48:01.458 --> 48:02.958
Let's go.

48:29.458 --> 48:30.583
Hey! Get down!

50:00.125 --> 50:01.541
Are you guys okay?

50:01.625 --> 50:02.708
Go!

50:33.375 --> 50:35.416
Lhan! Lhan!

50:38.041 --> 50:38.875
That's enough!

51:03.083 --> 51:03.916
Pran!

51:22.375 --> 51:23.208
Clear!

51:53.583 --> 51:54.500
Bring him here.

52:00.208 --> 52:01.791
-Lhan, come here!
-Take Lhan!

52:01.875 --> 52:03.000
-Pran!
-Come on!

52:03.083 --> 52:04.875
Doc, inject the factor!

52:06.250 --> 52:07.166
-Uncle!
-Relax, Lhan.

52:07.250 --> 52:09.041
-Uncle, what are you doing?
-Back off!

52:09.125 --> 52:10.625
Uncle! Uncle!

52:10.708 --> 52:12.708
-Go!
-Doc, hurry!

52:13.958 --> 52:15.000
Hold him still.

52:16.875 --> 52:18.000
Stay still.

52:18.875 --> 52:19.916
Calm down.

52:21.375 --> 52:22.875
Are you okay?

52:22.958 --> 52:23.875
Hurry!

52:30.250 --> 52:32.500
Lhek, go set up the other bed.

52:39.583 --> 52:40.833
M, come here!

52:40.916 --> 52:42.833
-Okay!
-Let's go.

52:50.833 --> 52:52.416
Pran. Pran.

52:53.291 --> 52:54.666
It won't stop bleeding.

52:55.750 --> 52:56.750
Keep pressure on it.

52:57.833 --> 52:58.875
Keep pressing.

53:02.583 --> 53:03.666
Stay still.

53:23.916 --> 53:24.875
Let's go!

54:20.125 --> 54:20.958
Pran.

54:21.916 --> 54:23.041
Pran!

54:29.916 --> 54:30.791
Ready?

54:31.375 --> 54:32.750
Uncle!

54:34.083 --> 54:34.916
Don't.

54:35.625 --> 54:36.750
Dad.

54:39.000 --> 54:40.500
-Don't.
-Pran, come here.

54:40.583 --> 54:42.375
Dad. Dad.

55:00.250 --> 55:01.708
-Let me go!
-Come here!

55:02.541 --> 55:03.375
Let me go.

55:03.458 --> 55:04.958
Lift him onto the bed.

55:05.833 --> 55:07.583
Lie down!

55:09.083 --> 55:10.083
On the bed.

55:11.250 --> 55:13.541
Get up here! Hold his legs down!

55:13.625 --> 55:15.041
-Quick.
-Hey! Hold him, quick.

55:16.083 --> 55:17.083
Fuck!

55:17.875 --> 55:19.125
-I don't want it!
-Hold him.

55:19.208 --> 55:20.791
-Stay still.
-M, let me go!

55:22.041 --> 55:24.125
-Fuck! I don't want this!
-Stay still!

55:24.208 --> 55:25.291
Stay still!

55:26.458 --> 55:27.291
Hold him down.

55:29.416 --> 55:30.291
Stay still.

55:30.375 --> 55:31.750
Hold the needle in place.

55:31.833 --> 55:33.041
Get her out of here.

55:34.833 --> 55:35.666
M.

55:36.291 --> 55:38.916
Get her out of here, M.

55:43.750 --> 55:44.708
It's okay.

56:45.500 --> 56:47.291
Pran is an Aurum Blood.

56:48.208 --> 56:50.125
And he has hemophilia.

56:51.958 --> 56:53.625
Only then did I realize

56:54.125 --> 56:55.875
I had been brought here

56:56.458 --> 56:58.666
to be his blood bank.

57:09.375 --> 57:10.416
Deaw!

57:39.875 --> 57:41.000
Open the door!

57:41.083 --> 57:42.708
Are you gonna open it?

57:43.208 --> 57:44.708
If you don't,

57:44.791 --> 57:46.708
your friend's fucking dead!

57:51.625 --> 57:53.583
I'm gonna start counting!

57:54.625 --> 57:56.500
One.

57:58.500 --> 58:00.166
Two.

58:16.041 --> 58:18.500
-So this is how we're doing things?
-Yeah!

58:19.833 --> 58:22.083
I know they won't open it. Pieces of shit.

58:23.375 --> 58:25.000
Can he make it out now?

58:26.500 --> 58:30.541
I'll need to give him
another shot of clotting factor.

58:31.208 --> 58:32.833
You already gave him one.

58:34.708 --> 58:39.208
Didn't you say we'd fight our way out?
If that's the case, he needs another shot.

58:40.083 --> 58:42.375
He can take the shot. Trust me.

59:27.958 --> 59:28.875
Can you do it?

59:30.875 --> 59:31.708
Yes.

59:32.666 --> 59:34.416
Ready to fight beside your dad?

01:00:19.625 --> 01:00:20.458
Let's go.

01:00:49.916 --> 01:00:51.166
Oh shit!

01:00:51.250 --> 01:00:53.083
Hey, get out of here! Quick!

01:02:00.625 --> 01:02:01.458
Dad!

01:02:08.125 --> 01:02:09.125
Shit.

01:02:11.458 --> 01:02:12.583
Shit.

01:02:12.666 --> 01:02:13.958
The system got hacked.

01:02:14.041 --> 01:02:15.375
The door's locked.

01:02:21.041 --> 01:02:23.208
Get everyone out. I'll handle this.

01:02:23.291 --> 01:02:24.958
-Hey, Doc! Quick!
-Uncle!

01:02:25.041 --> 01:02:26.958
-Dad!
-Pran!

01:02:47.708 --> 01:02:48.541
No.

01:02:54.583 --> 01:02:55.416
No.

01:02:55.500 --> 01:02:56.833
-Dad.
-No!

01:03:01.250 --> 01:03:02.250
Dad!

01:03:08.750 --> 01:03:09.625
-Don't!
-Dad!

01:03:09.708 --> 01:03:10.958
Don't do it!

01:03:40.458 --> 01:03:42.041
Let's go, hurry!

01:03:42.125 --> 01:03:42.958
Okay.

01:04:19.083 --> 01:04:20.000
Go!

01:04:30.041 --> 01:04:32.958
Dad!

01:04:39.166 --> 01:04:40.000
Pran.

01:04:40.708 --> 01:04:42.708
We gotta go now, kiddo. Let's go.

01:04:42.791 --> 01:04:44.708
I have to go save my dad, Uncle!

01:04:46.041 --> 01:04:47.958
Come on. We have to go now.

01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:52.208
Pran, hurry, kiddo! Let's go!

01:04:52.291 --> 01:04:54.291
-Let's go! We have to go!
-Uncle!

01:04:54.375 --> 01:04:55.833
You have to leave now.

01:04:56.958 --> 01:04:57.791
Dad!

01:04:58.333 --> 01:04:59.291
Calm down!

01:04:59.375 --> 01:05:03.333
Kid, just pull yourself together now!

01:05:04.125 --> 01:05:04.958
Go!

01:05:05.708 --> 01:05:08.166
They all died so we could survive.

01:05:08.250 --> 01:05:10.208
You got that? Let's go. Hurry!

01:05:11.708 --> 01:05:12.750
Uncle.

01:05:18.916 --> 01:05:19.750
Let's go!

01:05:25.125 --> 01:05:26.750
Dad!

01:06:53.291 --> 01:06:57.833
PRIVATE PROPERTY
TRESPASSERS WILL BE PROSECUTED

01:07:33.125 --> 01:07:33.958
Lhan.

01:07:34.958 --> 01:07:36.083
Where are you going?

01:07:36.166 --> 01:07:37.416
-Away from here.
-Lhan.

01:07:37.500 --> 01:07:40.291
Wait. This is the safest place right now.

01:07:40.875 --> 01:07:43.041
Wherever I am, no one is safe.

01:07:43.125 --> 01:07:45.541
No… No one thinks that, Lhan.

01:07:45.625 --> 01:07:47.541
Then you should. You should think that.

01:07:47.625 --> 01:07:49.208
My dad's dead. My mom's dead.

01:07:49.291 --> 01:07:52.333
And people in this house are dying
because of me. Think about that.

01:07:52.416 --> 01:07:54.416
Can you stop blaming yourself?

01:07:55.583 --> 01:07:56.708
Please.

01:07:57.208 --> 01:07:59.625
Everyone here loves you.

01:07:59.708 --> 01:08:00.541
Love?

01:08:01.208 --> 01:08:04.083
Do they love me for who I am?
Or do they love me for my blood?

01:08:05.375 --> 01:08:06.500
I'd give it all.

01:08:06.583 --> 01:08:08.500
I'd give everything for the people I love.

01:08:08.583 --> 01:08:11.666
But not like this.
Not after being lied to like this.

01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:16.125
-Not even you ever told me anything!
-I didn't know!

01:08:17.291 --> 01:08:22.291
I didn't know, okay? Neither did Pran.
How would we know anyone's blood type?

01:08:22.791 --> 01:08:27.208
When the uncles brought you home,
they just said you had no one left.

01:08:27.833 --> 01:08:29.833
Isn't that normal for this house?

01:08:29.916 --> 01:08:31.958
I don't have anyone else either.

01:08:43.500 --> 01:08:46.500
I know you feel
like the uncles disappointed you.

01:08:49.208 --> 01:08:50.625
I feel the same way.

01:08:53.250 --> 01:08:55.083
I think Pran took it very hard too.

01:08:58.875 --> 01:09:00.000
But trust me.

01:09:00.500 --> 01:09:03.083
This is the best damn home
we could ever have.

01:09:05.875 --> 01:09:07.458
And the two of you

01:09:08.291 --> 01:09:10.625
are so damn lucky you found each other.

01:09:45.125 --> 01:09:46.916
Hey. Hang on.

01:09:48.041 --> 01:09:49.791
Hey, take it easy.

01:09:49.875 --> 01:09:51.500
Yeah.

01:09:54.958 --> 01:09:57.958
You're recovering
faster than I expected, kid.

01:09:58.041 --> 01:10:02.041
At this rate, in a couple of months,
you'll be raising hell again.

01:10:02.125 --> 01:10:03.166
Yeah.

01:10:03.250 --> 01:10:04.500
Uncle.

01:10:06.541 --> 01:10:09.500
I know Dad set aside some money for Lhan.

01:10:10.208 --> 01:10:11.291
He told me.

01:10:14.291 --> 01:10:16.958
Can you and M help Lhan
find a place to stay?

01:10:17.458 --> 01:10:19.583
Take her somewhere safe.

01:10:20.791 --> 01:10:24.916
Stay with her until she's doing okay.
Then we'll go our separate ways.

01:10:25.416 --> 01:10:26.541
Go our separate ways?

01:10:27.250 --> 01:10:28.166
Go where?

01:10:28.958 --> 01:10:32.708
I want Lhan to be safe.
I want everyone to be safe.

01:10:34.375 --> 01:10:36.041
We can't lose anyone else.

01:10:36.708 --> 01:10:39.041
There's no safe place for Lhan anymore.

01:10:45.833 --> 01:10:47.375
She'll be hunted.

01:10:48.125 --> 01:10:49.791
We'll be killed.

01:10:50.333 --> 01:10:54.291
The Mala gang has to wipe us out.
If they don't, they won't last.

01:10:55.041 --> 01:10:57.000
Everyone knows that rule.

01:10:58.166 --> 01:11:00.125
No one will be safe.

01:11:00.208 --> 01:11:02.791
No one gets to live their lives

01:11:03.458 --> 01:11:05.041
until this is over.

01:11:38.750 --> 01:11:40.625
The day I asked you to run away…

01:11:43.041 --> 01:11:45.750
that's when I found out
you're an Aurum Blood too.

01:11:46.666 --> 01:11:49.583
Before that, I never knew
why you had to be here.

01:11:50.083 --> 01:11:52.291
I thought Dad just took you in
like he did M.

01:11:54.166 --> 01:11:55.375
I'm sorry.

01:11:56.625 --> 01:11:58.708
On behalf of Dad and everyone.

01:11:58.791 --> 01:12:00.125
I'm sorry.

01:12:00.625 --> 01:12:02.208
I'm so goddamn sorry.

01:12:03.125 --> 01:12:04.416
I really am.

01:12:21.333 --> 01:12:22.166
Lhan.

01:12:26.208 --> 01:12:28.750
-I--
-The pain always hits right here.

01:12:30.791 --> 01:12:32.041
Every single time.

01:12:33.500 --> 01:12:35.166
Whenever I think about my parents.

01:12:42.875 --> 01:12:45.125
I have to try and swallow it every time.

01:12:46.416 --> 01:12:47.958
And it's tough every time.

01:12:50.416 --> 01:12:52.208
I've had two homes in my life.

01:12:52.916 --> 01:12:54.666
My first family died because of me.

01:12:56.791 --> 01:12:58.833
This one's dying because of me too.

01:13:02.000 --> 01:13:04.458
If nowhere in this world's
safe enough for me,

01:13:04.541 --> 01:13:07.291
I have to be dangerous enough
to protect myself.

01:13:08.250 --> 01:13:09.208
Don't I?

01:13:13.333 --> 01:13:14.166
Pran.

01:13:14.666 --> 01:13:16.916
You have to teach me to kill.

01:13:20.041 --> 01:13:22.416
I won't be a burden to anyone again.

01:13:22.500 --> 01:13:25.791
I won't have to worry every night
about who'll be gone when I wake up.

01:13:25.875 --> 01:13:28.083
I want to see him die in front of me.

01:13:28.583 --> 01:13:29.750
With my own eyes.

01:13:32.666 --> 01:13:34.875
You have to let me be an assassin.

01:13:42.125 --> 01:13:46.208
You can't say you want to be one
and make it happen just like that.

01:13:46.833 --> 01:13:50.375
Okay? People train years for this,
sometimes their whole lives.

01:13:51.291 --> 01:13:52.958
We'll do as much as we can.

01:13:54.625 --> 01:13:57.291
If Lhan can protect herself,
it's better for her.

01:13:57.375 --> 01:13:58.416
And for everyone.

01:14:00.333 --> 01:14:03.791
And if she can protect herself,
she gets to choose whether to stay or go.

01:14:05.250 --> 01:14:06.458
I want her to choose.

01:14:08.458 --> 01:14:12.541
Keep indulging her like this,
and it's her who'll be in danger.

01:14:13.666 --> 01:14:15.625
We're fighting assassins.

01:14:15.708 --> 01:14:17.000
Not an old lady next door.

01:14:18.333 --> 01:14:21.291
So let's do what Pran said, Uncle.
Do as much as we can.

01:14:21.375 --> 01:14:24.625
Maybe the old lady next door's
more dangerous than an assassin.

01:14:31.166 --> 01:14:32.583
-Get ready.
-What?

01:14:36.375 --> 01:14:37.875
M, come on.

01:14:37.958 --> 01:14:38.791
What?

01:14:38.875 --> 01:14:40.625
-Come at me.
-Okay.

01:14:45.625 --> 01:14:47.333
Shit!

01:14:54.541 --> 01:14:56.291
-Gang up on her.
-What?

01:14:56.791 --> 01:14:57.625
Go!

01:15:11.625 --> 01:15:13.333
Quick thinking, good reactions.

01:15:13.416 --> 01:15:16.041
But your leg power
and punches are weak. Your core too.

01:15:16.541 --> 01:15:19.541
Your speed, accuracy,
and flexibility need work.

01:15:20.041 --> 01:15:20.958
Too impulsive.

01:15:21.583 --> 01:15:24.875
Aren't you? You just charge right in.
You don't know your limits.

01:15:24.958 --> 01:15:27.583
You'll die even faster
than the old lady next door.

01:15:29.916 --> 01:15:31.708
But if you're serious, let's start.

01:15:35.208 --> 01:15:39.625
Strength training. Impact training.
Weapons, tactics, and long-range combat.

01:15:40.125 --> 01:15:43.875
To kill someone who's trying to kill you,
make sure you don't get killed first.

01:16:09.833 --> 01:16:11.000
Assemble it.

01:16:20.916 --> 01:16:25.041
Pull it up so the needle tip… Okay.

01:16:29.625 --> 01:16:30.625
Do it again.

01:16:35.666 --> 01:16:36.750
Get up!

01:16:36.833 --> 01:16:38.708
Stand up! Do it again!

01:16:42.916 --> 01:16:43.833
Tense your stomach.

01:16:43.916 --> 01:16:45.541
Breathe. Breathe.

01:16:49.708 --> 01:16:50.708
Again!

01:17:04.125 --> 01:17:06.166
Hey!

01:17:06.250 --> 01:17:07.375
You got it.

01:19:09.625 --> 01:19:11.000
If I don't make it…

01:19:13.375 --> 01:19:14.750
you have to look after Lhan.

01:19:16.625 --> 01:19:17.666
Are you serious?

01:19:19.125 --> 01:19:22.083
What are you talking about?
For real? You think you're gonna die?

01:19:22.833 --> 01:19:25.833
If I die, you'll have to live
and look after her.

01:19:26.958 --> 01:19:28.791
I don't want her to be left all alone.

01:19:35.250 --> 01:19:36.791
You're giving me these orders.

01:19:37.916 --> 01:19:39.583
Do you know I like her?

01:19:40.333 --> 01:19:41.166
Over there.

01:19:42.416 --> 01:19:44.041
I could see it from over there.

01:19:56.958 --> 01:19:58.375
When do you think

01:19:59.583 --> 01:20:01.166
they'll find us?

01:20:17.625 --> 01:20:18.916
Hello, sir.

01:20:19.000 --> 01:20:20.916
Which car are you interested in?

01:20:21.000 --> 01:20:22.291
USED CAR DEALERSHIP

01:20:27.041 --> 01:20:28.458
Have you had this one for long?

01:20:28.958 --> 01:20:30.750
That's been here for a while now, sir.

01:20:30.833 --> 01:20:32.625
NO DOWN PAYMENT

01:20:33.750 --> 01:20:34.583
Go on.

01:20:39.583 --> 01:20:40.833
Here you go, sir.

01:20:46.833 --> 01:20:47.833
Okay.

01:20:47.916 --> 01:20:49.208
So almost two months?

01:20:55.416 --> 01:20:58.083
Do you know where they went from here?

01:21:19.833 --> 01:21:22.708
If you want to sever a large artery
or the aorta,

01:21:23.291 --> 01:21:24.500
you need a lot of force.

01:21:27.583 --> 01:21:29.125
And you have to be precise.

01:21:32.666 --> 01:21:34.666
Vital points are usually hard to reach.

01:21:34.750 --> 01:21:36.958
The body's built this way
to protect itself.

01:21:40.541 --> 01:21:41.916
Imagine this is the ribcage.

01:21:42.500 --> 01:21:43.791
It's like body armor.

01:21:43.875 --> 01:21:47.166
The critical arteries are hidden behind…

01:21:53.708 --> 01:21:54.666
Sorry.

01:21:56.500 --> 01:21:57.500
Let's try again.

01:22:06.833 --> 01:22:07.666
Here.

01:22:09.875 --> 01:22:11.541
These two points are crucial.

01:22:13.041 --> 01:22:16.541
Attacking from a distance can be hard,
but if you're close,

01:22:16.625 --> 01:22:18.750
stab and cut them with scissors,
and it's over.

01:22:19.833 --> 01:22:20.833
Right here.

01:22:22.583 --> 01:22:23.791
Try to remember that.

01:22:28.583 --> 01:22:30.625
Wouldn't the abdominal area be easier?

01:22:34.666 --> 01:22:35.791
Not exactly.

01:22:40.000 --> 01:22:41.875
Actually, the aorta

01:22:42.541 --> 01:22:45.083
might start at the front of the heart…

01:22:47.958 --> 01:22:50.125
but it curves around to the back.

01:22:54.666 --> 01:22:56.125
It runs along the spine…

01:23:00.125 --> 01:23:01.500
through the diaphragm…

01:23:03.833 --> 01:23:05.416
and down into the abdomen.

01:23:10.416 --> 01:23:11.916
It's very deep inside.

01:23:15.416 --> 01:23:18.333
There's skin, layers of fat,

01:23:19.208 --> 01:23:20.791
and muscles in the way.

01:23:23.375 --> 01:23:24.833
If you wanna make it fatal,

01:23:25.666 --> 01:23:29.958
you have to get in close
and push the knife all the way in.

01:23:30.041 --> 01:23:31.541
That's how you make it work.

01:23:37.541 --> 01:23:39.000
-I'll try it again.
-Lhan.

01:23:43.500 --> 01:23:46.000
When you can look after yourself
like you want to…

01:23:48.541 --> 01:23:49.916
can you stay?

01:26:03.333 --> 01:26:05.000
Let's eat.

01:26:05.500 --> 01:26:07.083
-Wow.
-Wow.

01:26:07.583 --> 01:26:08.625
Nice.

01:26:11.208 --> 01:26:14.041
This looks just like Ja's fried rice.

01:26:16.666 --> 01:26:17.708
Did she teach you?

01:26:20.083 --> 01:26:21.916
I've seen her make it. I know how.

01:26:30.875 --> 01:26:31.833
It's delicious.

01:26:34.458 --> 01:26:37.916
If Deaw were here,
he'd eat four or five plates by himself.

01:27:01.916 --> 01:27:04.333
If we want to live our lives
the way we want…

01:27:06.666 --> 01:27:08.458
what do we do to get there together?

01:27:17.750 --> 01:27:19.083
If we run…

01:27:21.041 --> 01:27:22.458
we have to keep running.

01:27:24.125 --> 01:27:25.375
If we hide,

01:27:26.375 --> 01:27:28.000
we have to keep doing this.

01:27:29.708 --> 01:27:30.958
If we fight,

01:27:32.333 --> 01:27:33.416
maybe it'll end.

01:27:34.791 --> 01:27:36.333
But I don't know how it'll end.

01:27:43.000 --> 01:27:47.625
And if I ask you all to fight
without knowing how it'll end…

01:27:50.291 --> 01:27:51.541
is anyone with me?

01:27:53.125 --> 01:27:54.125
I'm in.

01:27:55.833 --> 01:27:57.208
Wait.

01:27:59.500 --> 01:28:02.708
How many of us are there?
How can we possibly win?

01:28:03.541 --> 01:28:05.333
And what's the plan?

01:28:10.750 --> 01:28:12.125
We flip the script, Uncle.

01:28:16.208 --> 01:28:19.916
We turn the hunted into the hunters.
We stop hiding and start fighting.

01:29:06.458 --> 01:29:07.583
Don't forget.

01:29:08.250 --> 01:29:10.583
Be careful with the girl
and the guy I mentioned.

01:29:10.666 --> 01:29:12.500
Do whatever you like with the rest.

01:29:13.208 --> 01:29:14.583
What's up with those two?

01:29:14.666 --> 01:29:17.500
Do they have good karma on their side?
Why all the caution?

01:29:19.375 --> 01:29:20.916
They're ghosts from my past.

01:29:22.125 --> 01:29:25.291
My team's coming too,
but don't worry about the bounty.

01:29:25.375 --> 01:29:27.000
Your team can take it all.

01:29:42.416 --> 01:29:45.000
If anyone asks
about buying my van, call me.

01:29:45.500 --> 01:29:46.333
Hello.

01:29:47.125 --> 01:29:49.666
Someone just showed up.
He looked kind of high-class.

01:31:09.666 --> 01:31:11.083
Shit.

01:32:11.125 --> 01:32:12.041
Come on!

01:37:20.083 --> 01:37:20.916
Doc!

01:41:11.916 --> 01:41:13.458
Wait!

01:42:30.291 --> 01:42:31.166
Pran.

01:42:36.208 --> 01:42:38.375
Where are the others?
Where are the others?

01:42:44.916 --> 01:42:46.791
Let's go.

01:43:49.833 --> 01:43:51.750
Lhan! Lhan!

01:43:52.250 --> 01:43:53.250
Shit!

01:43:59.000 --> 01:44:00.833
-What do we do?
-Just drive!

01:44:22.041 --> 01:44:23.208
Lhan.

01:44:24.208 --> 01:44:26.166
M, take us to a hospital.

01:44:32.000 --> 01:44:33.333
Shit!

01:44:33.833 --> 01:44:35.041
Where is it?

01:44:35.541 --> 01:44:37.166
Where's the hospital?

01:44:37.750 --> 01:44:38.583
Lhan.

01:44:39.208 --> 01:44:42.875
You're gonna be okay.
The bullet went through. You'll be fine.

01:44:46.791 --> 01:44:48.625
M, Lhan's going into shock.

01:44:53.125 --> 01:44:55.708
-I gotta give her blood.
-No way, Pran!

01:44:55.791 --> 01:44:56.666
Pull over.

01:45:00.791 --> 01:45:02.041
Just pull over!

01:45:05.208 --> 01:45:07.833
-How are you gonna give her blood?
-Doc must've prepped it.

01:45:10.541 --> 01:45:11.708
Shit!

01:45:20.333 --> 01:45:21.833
M, help me.

01:45:23.083 --> 01:45:23.916
Okay.

01:45:26.083 --> 01:45:26.916
One…

01:45:35.541 --> 01:45:36.458
Pran.

01:45:37.083 --> 01:45:38.625
You'll die.

01:45:41.958 --> 01:45:45.291
After I give her blood,
just get me to a hospital.

01:46:38.041 --> 01:46:39.041
Let's go.

01:46:47.500 --> 01:46:49.125
-Shit!
-M!

01:46:49.208 --> 01:46:50.541
Fuck!

01:46:52.958 --> 01:46:54.416
-M!
-I'm okay.

01:47:03.166 --> 01:47:05.541
Stop. I'll handle this.

01:47:08.541 --> 01:47:09.541
M.

01:47:11.416 --> 01:47:13.916
-You have to stay with Lhan.
-M.

01:47:15.000 --> 01:47:16.833
M!

01:47:45.541 --> 01:47:46.375
Lhan.

01:49:38.875 --> 01:49:39.875
Fuck!

01:50:24.166 --> 01:50:25.583
Get off me!

01:51:20.583 --> 01:51:22.583
Yeah, I know. I really do.

01:51:23.750 --> 01:51:25.208
I know she likes you.

01:51:27.125 --> 01:51:28.791
She likes being with you.

01:51:29.333 --> 01:51:30.875
That's why you gotta live.

01:51:30.958 --> 01:51:32.083
You gotta live too.

01:51:34.000 --> 01:51:36.125
Because we all like being together.

01:51:38.125 --> 01:51:40.666
You and I will take the best care of her.

01:53:25.625 --> 01:53:28.375
Make sure you live your life
the way you want to.

01:53:33.708 --> 01:53:35.291
I'll be here with you.

01:56:11.500 --> 01:56:12.333
Pran.

01:56:15.875 --> 01:56:16.708
Pran.

01:56:35.416 --> 01:56:36.250
Pran.

01:57:44.208 --> 01:57:46.708
Make sure you live your life
the way you want to.

01:57:51.041 --> 01:57:52.125
I'll be here with you.

01:58:16.041 --> 01:58:19.541
VIETNAM

01:59:31.791 --> 01:59:34.500
This kid has
the rarest blood type in the world.

01:59:38.000 --> 01:59:40.250
He has to be able
to take good care of himself.

01:59:44.166 --> 01:59:48.541
He deserves the freedom to live his life
without being afraid of anything.

01:59:54.250 --> 01:59:56.083
The freedom that so many people

01:59:56.750 --> 01:59:57.958
gave to me.

02:00:04.083 --> 02:00:07.125
I'll do my best
to protect the life I have left.

02:00:09.125 --> 02:00:13.125
I won't let a single drop of blood
leave my body again.

02:00:20.041 --> 02:00:22.250
Because it's not just my blood anymore.

02:00:23.250 --> 02:00:27.583
It's the blood of the one I love
flowing together with mine.

02:00:56.541 --> 02:00:58.375
Sorry to keep you waiting.

02:01:02.333 --> 02:01:04.625
Very hard to find.

02:07:30.500 --> 02:07:33.416
Subtitle translation by: Tanchira Arjinkit
